msgstr "Cancel"

msgid "quitBattle/leaver/descriptionAlive"
msgstr ""
"Your team still needs you! If you leave the battle, your team will be at a "
"disadvantage, and you will not receive any bonuses or make any mission "
"progress."

msgid "quitBattle/leaver/submit"
msgstr "Leave"

msgid "quitBattle/leaver/title"
msgstr "You are leaving the battle"

