msgid "tooltips/eventPoints/body"
msgstr ""
"Earn Data Packets to complete Data Blocks and obtain valuable resources, "
"including a significant reward. Data Packets can be earned by dealing "
"damage, destroying enemies in battle, capturing points and completing daily "
"missions."

