msgid "welcomeScreen/button"
msgstr "Continue"

msgid "welcomeScreen/description1"
msgstr ""
"You are part of an armored task force ordered to secure and hold a secretive"
" network across a contested zone. Keep the network under your control at all"
" costs."

msgid "welcomeScreen/description2"
msgstr ""
"Someone went to great lengths to keep this intelligence hidden. Complete "
"missions to recover encrypted fragments."

msgid "welcomeScreen/description3"
msgstr ""
"Complete the Data Blocks to receive valuable rewards from event missions."

